{"unit_id":"shaobeichen__dsh-pocket#card-zh","repo":"shaobeichen/dsh-pocket","commit":"aee3ae7e97516206049394c7a37dc38778ffb6da","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Pocket 是 DeepSeek Harness Web 的手机访问插件。它在 DSH 启动时开启本机反向代理，将手机浏览器请求转发到电脑上的 dsh web，并在设置页提供局域网二维码与可选的 Cloudflare 公网二维码。用户可切换局域网访问、管理 PIN，配置快速或固定域名隧道；移动端提供响应式布局、导航抽屉、会话日志下载与远程文件内容复制。适合离开电脑时继续查看和操作正在运行的 DSH 会话。基础局域网访问无需额外账号或 API key；公网访问需要 cloudflared 网络连接，固定域名模式还需 Cloudflare Tunnel token 与域名。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:304-367","lib/service.mjs:275-302","client/index.jsx:656-691","client/mobile/mobile-apply.tsx:363-396"]}
{"unit_id":"shaobeichen__dsh-pocket#card-en","repo":"shaobeichen/dsh-pocket","commit":"aee3ae7e97516206049394c7a37dc38778ffb6da","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Pocket lets a phone reach DeepSeek Harness Web running on a computer. It starts a local reverse proxy, shows LAN and optional Cloudflare tunnel QR codes, and adds mobile navigation, session log download, and remote file copy. Named tunnels use a token.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:304-367","lib/service.mjs:275-302","client/index.jsx:656-691","client/mobile/mobile-apply.tsx:363-396"]}
